                    ? 'A claim needs a date on or before its person\'s retirement.'
                    : c.status === 'OPEN' || c.status === 'PENDING'
                    ? 'Only a steward can re-date a claim.'
                    : `A ${c.status} claim cannot be re-dated.`}</span>
